{
 "openapi": "3.1.0",
 "info": {
  "title": "Abyshire Baoulé API",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "description": "Baoulé (bci) translation, speech recognition, speech synthesis and search embeddings.\n\nTwo surfaces share one deployment and one key:\n* **Native routes** (compatible with API 1.1.0, used by langchain-ivoire's remote backend and the apps):\n  `/v1/translate`, `/listen_bci`, `/tts_bci`, `/speak_bci`, `/v1/languages`, `/v1/models`, `/health`.\n  Every native route is also served under `/v1` (e.g. `/v1/listen_bci`), and `/v1/listen` / `/v1/speak` are\n  aliases of `/listen_bci` / `/tts_bci`.\n* **OpenAI-compatible routes**: `/v1/chat/completions` (translation), `/v1/audio/transcriptions`,\n  `/v1/audio/speech`, `/v1/embeddings`, `/v1/models`.\n\n**Authentication:** `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Each key carries scopes: `translate`, `listen`, `speak`,\n`embed`. A route outside the key's scopes answers 403 `forbidden`. Only `/health` is open (no key, cheap); every other route, `/ready` included, needs a valid key.\n\n**Models** (product ids): `abyshire/translate-baoule`, `abyshire/listen-baoule`, `abyshire/speak-baoule`,\n`abyshire/embed-baoule`.\n\n**Translation convention (chat completions):** the text is the last `user` message. Direction and style come\nfrom the top-level `translation` object first, else from a `system` message\n`ivoire-translate source=<code> target=<code> style=<style>`, else from language names in the system message,\nelse French -> Baoulé, everyday. Codes `bci`, `fra`, `eng`; styles `everyday`, `tale`, `formal`. The reply content is the translation only.\nEnglish <-> Baoulé goes through French; the French is returned in `translation.pivot` / `pivot.fra`.\n\n**Usage on every response:** tokens (translation, embeddings), seconds of audio (transcription), characters\n(speech; in the `X-Usage-Characters` header because the body is audio). Streaming chat responses end with a\nusage chunk.\n\n**Errors:** native routes answer RFC 9457 `application/problem+json` `{type, title, status, detail, code}`.\nOpenAI-compatible routes answer `{\"error\": {\"message\", \"type\", \"code\", \"param\"}}` and also carry the problem\nfields at the top level. Stable codes: invalid_request, unsupported_language, unauthorized, forbidden,\nnot_found, method_not_allowed, idempotency_conflict, too_large, rate_limited, internal,\nupstream_unavailable, model_not_found.\n\n**Capacity:** when the processing queue is full the API answers 429 `rate_limited` at once, with\n`Retry-After` (seconds). 503 `upstream_unavailable` (with `Retry-After`) while models load or a service is\noff.\n\n**Data:** zero retention. Request bodies are processed in memory and never stored; only metering data\n(key label, route, counts, durations, status) is logged. Generated audio for `audio_url` is kept in memory\nfor at most 5 minutes.\n\nEvery response carries `X-Request-Id` (send one to have it echoed). POST requests accept `Idempotency-Key`\n(native routes; responses cached in memory for 10 minutes per caller, route and key).\n"
 },
 "servers": [
  {
   "url": "https://api.abyshire.ci",
   "description": "Abyshire API"
  }
 ],
 "security": [
  {
   "bearer": []
  }
 ],
 "tags": [
  {
   "name": "native",
   "description": "Native API (compatible with 1.1.0)"
  },
  {
   "name": "openai",
   "description": "OpenAI-compatible API"
  },
  {
   "name": "ops",
   "description": "Health (no key) and readiness (any valid key)"
  }
 ],
 "paths": {
  "/v1/translate": {
   "post": {
    "tags": [
     "native"
    ],
    "operationId": "translate",
    "summary": "Translate texts (bci/fra/eng). Also served at /translate, /translations, /v1/translations.",
    "description": "Scope `translate`. bci<->fra in one step; eng<->bci goes through French (returned in `pivot.fra`).\nStyles: everyday (default), tale, formal.\n",
    "parameters": [
     {
      "$ref": "#/components/parameters/RequestId"
     },
     {
      "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
     }
    ],
    "requestBody": {
     "required": true,
     "content": {
      "application/json": {
       "schema": {
        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TranslateRequest"
       }
      }
     }
    },
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "OK",
      "headers": {
       "X-Request-Id": {
        "$ref": "#/components/headers/RequestId"
       }
      },
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TranslateResponse"
        }
       }
      }
     },
     "400": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "401": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "403": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "409": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "413": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "429": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem429"
     },
     "503": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem503"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "/listen_bci": {
   "post": {
    "tags": [
     "native"
    ],
    "operationId": "listen_bci",
    "summary": "Baoulé speech -> Baoulé text (+ French/English). Aliases /v1/listen_bci, /v1/listen.",
    "description": "Scope `listen`. The French and English translations are filled only when the key also has `translate`\n(and `translate` is not 0); otherwise they are empty strings. Any audio container ffmpeg can decode;\nat most 120 s and 20 MB.\n",
    "parameters": [
     {
      "name": "translate",
      "in": "query",
      "required": false,
      "schema": {
       "type": "integer",
       "enum": [
        0,
        1
       ],
       "default": 1
      }
     },
     {
      "$ref": "#/components/parameters/RequestId"
     },
     {
      "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
     }
    ],
    "requestBody": {
     "required": true,
     "content": {
      "multipart/form-data": {
       "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
         "audio"
        ],
        "properties": {
         "audio": {
          "type": "string",
          "contentMediaType": "application/octet-stream"
         }
        }
       }
      }
     }
    },
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "OK (more fields may be added)",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ListenResponse"
        }
       }
      }
     },
     "400": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "401": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "403": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "413": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "429": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem429"
     },
     "503": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem503"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "/tts_bci": {
   "post": {
    "tags": [
     "native"
    ],
    "operationId": "tts_bci",
    "summary": "Speak a Baoulé text. Aliases /v1/tts_bci, /v1/speak.",
    "description": "Scope `speak` (approval only). Returns a relative `audio_url` (fetch BASE + audio_url within 5 minutes,\nsame key), or the WAV inline as base64 with `?b64=1`.\n",
    "parameters": [
     {
      "name": "b64",
      "in": "query",
      "required": false,
      "schema": {
       "type": "integer",
       "enum": [
        0,
        1
       ],
       "default": 0
      }
     },
     {
      "$ref": "#/components/parameters/RequestId"
     },
     {
      "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
     }
    ],
    "requestBody": {
     "required": true,
     "content": {
      "application/json": {
       "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
         "bci"
        ],
        "properties": {
         "bci": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 2000
         }
        }
       }
      }
     }
    },
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "OK",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TtsResponse"
        }
       }
      }
     },
     "400": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "401": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "403": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "429": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem429"
     },
     "503": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem503"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "/speak_bci": {
   "post": {
    "tags": [
     "native"
    ],
    "operationId": "speak_bci",
    "summary": "English (or French) text -> Baoulé text + speech. Alias /v1/speak_bci.",
    "description": "Scopes `translate` and `speak`. `{\"text\": English}` or `{\"fra\": French}`.",
    "parameters": [
     {
      "$ref": "#/components/parameters/RequestId"
     },
     {
      "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
     }
    ],
    "requestBody": {
     "required": true,
     "content": {
      "application/json": {
       "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
         "text": {
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 1000
         },
         "fra": {
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 1000
         },
         "style": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Style"
         }
        }
       }
      }
     }
    },
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "OK",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SpeakResponse"
        }
       }
      }
     },
     "400": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "401": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "403": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "429": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem429"
     },
     "503": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem503"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "/audio/{aid}.wav": {
   "get": {
    "tags": [
     "native"
    ],
    "operationId": "get_audio",
    "summary": "Audio made by /tts_bci or /speak_bci (5 minutes, same key). Alias /v1/audio/{aid}.wav.",
    "parameters": [
     {
      "name": "aid",
      "in": "path",
      "required": true,
      "schema": {
       "type": "string",
       "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,64}$"
      }
     }
    ],
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "WAV audio",
      "content": {
       "audio/wav": {
        "schema": {
         "type": "string",
         "contentMediaType": "audio/wav"
        }
       }
      }
     },
     "401": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     },
     "404": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "/v1/languages": {
   "get": {
    "tags": [
     "native"
    ],
    "operationId": "languages",
    "summary": "Supported languages. Also /languages.",
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "OK",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LanguagesResponse"
        }
       }
      }
     },
     "401": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "/v1/models": {
   "get": {
    "tags": [
     "native",
     "openai"
    ],
    "operationId": "models",
    "summary": "Product models (OpenAI / OpenRouter list format plus the native fields). Also /models.",
    "description": "`data` is the OpenAI/OpenRouter model list: id, modalities, limits, prices, access (`public` or `approval`) and datacenter locations. The native fields (`api_version`,\n`mt`, `asr`, `tts`, `embed`) keep API 1.1.0 clients working. Product names and dates only.\n",
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "OK",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ModelsResponse"
        }
       }
      }
     },
     "401": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/Problem"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "/v1/chat/completions": {
   "post": {
    "tags": [
     "openai"
    ],
    "operationId": "chat_completions",
    "summary": "Translation as a chat completion (abyshire/translate-baoule). Scope `translate`.",
    "requestBody": {
     "required": true,
     "content": {
      "application/json": {
       "schema": {
        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatRequest"
       }
      }
     }
    },
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "A completion, or a text/event-stream when `stream` is true (chunks, then a usage chunk with empty `choices`, then `data: [DONE]`).",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatCompletion"
        }
       },
       "text/event-stream": {
        "schema": {
         "type": "string"
        }
       }
      }
     },
     "400": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "401": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "403": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "404": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "413": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "429": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "503": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "/v1/audio/transcriptions": {
   "post": {
    "tags": [
     "openai"
    ],
    "operationId": "audio_transcriptions",
    "summary": "Baoulé speech recognition (abyshire/listen-baoule). Scope `listen`.",
    "requestBody": {
     "required": true,
     "content": {
      "multipart/form-data": {
       "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
         "file"
        ],
        "properties": {
         "file": {
          "type": "string",
          "contentMediaType": "application/octet-stream"
         },
         "model": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "abyshire/listen-baoule"
         },
         "language": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "bci (ISO 639-3); \"bau\" is accepted as the same language"
         },
         "response_format": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
           "json",
           "text",
           "verbose_json"
          ],
          "default": "json"
         },
         "prompt": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "ignored"
         },
         "temperature": {
          "type": "number",
          "description": "ignored"
         }
        }
       }
      }
     }
    },
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "OK",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Transcription"
        }
       },
       "text/plain": {
        "schema": {
         "type": "string"
        }
       }
      }
     },
     "400": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "401": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "403": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "413": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "429": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "503": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "/v1/audio/speech": {
   "post": {
    "tags": [
     "openai"
    ],
    "operationId": "audio_speech",
    "summary": "Baoulé speech synthesis (abyshire/speak-baoule). Scope `speak` (approval only).",
    "description": "`wav` (default) is a complete WAV file (22.05 kHz mono 16-bit). `pcm` streams raw 16-bit little-endian\nmono at 24 kHz as it is generated. `mp3`, `opus`, `flac` are encoded after synthesis. `voice` and `speed`\nare accepted; there is one voice and `speed` is ignored. Usage: header `X-Usage-Characters` (and\n`X-Usage-Audio-Seconds` when known before the body is sent).\n",
    "requestBody": {
     "required": true,
     "content": {
      "application/json": {
       "schema": {
        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SpeechRequest"
       }
      }
     }
    },
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "Audio bytes",
      "headers": {
       "X-Usage-Characters": {
        "schema": {
         "type": "integer"
        }
       },
       "X-Usage-Audio-Seconds": {
        "schema": {
         "type": "number"
        }
       }
      },
      "content": {
       "audio/wav": {
        "schema": {
         "type": "string",
         "contentMediaType": "audio/wav"
        }
       },
       "audio/pcm": {
        "schema": {
         "type": "string"
        }
       },
       "audio/mpeg": {
        "schema": {
         "type": "string"
        }
       },
       "audio/ogg": {
        "schema": {
         "type": "string"
        }
       },
       "audio/flac": {
        "schema": {
         "type": "string"
        }
       }
      }
     },
     "400": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "401": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "403": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "429": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "503": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "/v1/embeddings": {
   "post": {
    "tags": [
     "openai"
    ],
    "operationId": "embeddings",
    "summary": "Baoulé/French search embeddings (abyshire/embed-baoule, 768 dimensions). Scope `embed`.",
    "requestBody": {
     "required": true,
     "content": {
      "application/json": {
       "schema": {
        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EmbeddingsRequest"
       }
      }
     }
    },
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "OK",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EmbeddingsResponse"
        }
       }
      }
     },
     "400": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "401": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "403": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "413": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "429": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     },
     "503": {
      "$ref": "#/components/responses/OpenAIError"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "/health": {
   "get": {
    "tags": [
     "ops"
    ],
    "operationId": "health",
    "summary": "Liveness (no key). Also /v1/health.",
    "security": [],
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "Process is up (models may still be loading; see /ready)",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Health"
        }
       }
      }
     }
    }
   }
  }
 },
 "components": {
  "securitySchemes": {
   "bearer": {
    "type": "http",
    "scheme": "bearer"
   }
  },
  "parameters": {
   "RequestId": {
    "name": "X-Request-Id",
    "in": "header",
    "required": false,
    "schema": {
     "type": "string",
     "maxLength": 128,
     "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9._:\\-]{1,128}$"
    }
   },
   "IdempotencyKey": {
    "name": "Idempotency-Key",
    "in": "header",
    "required": false,
    "schema": {
     "type": "string",
     "maxLength": 200
    }
   }
  },
  "headers": {
   "RequestId": {
    "schema": {
     "type": "string"
    }
   },
   "RetryAfter": {
    "schema": {
     "type": "integer"
    }
   }
  },
  "responses": {
   "Problem": {
    "description": "problem+json",
    "content": {
     "application/problem+json": {
      "schema": {
       "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   "Problem429": {
    "description": "rate_limited (queue full); Retry-After in seconds",
    "headers": {
     "Retry-After": {
      "$ref": "#/components/headers/RetryAfter"
     }
    },
    "content": {
     "application/problem+json": {
      "schema": {
       "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   "Problem503": {
    "description": "upstream_unavailable (loading, or the service is off); Retry-After in seconds",
    "headers": {
     "Retry-After": {
      "$ref": "#/components/headers/RetryAfter"
     }
    },
    "content": {
     "application/problem+json": {
      "schema": {
       "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   "OpenAIError": {
    "description": "OpenAI-style error (with the problem fields at the top level too)",
    "content": {
     "application/json": {
      "schema": {
       "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
      }
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "schemas": {
   "Lang": {
    "type": "string",
    "enum": [
     "bci",
     "fra",
     "eng"
    ]
   },
   "Style": {
    "type": "string",
    "enum": [
     "everyday",
     "tale",
     "formal"
    ],
    "default": "everyday",
    "description": "everyday (default), tale (storytelling register), formal."
   },
   "TranslateRequest": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": [
     "texts",
     "source",
     "target"
    ],
    "properties": {
     "texts": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "maxItems": 32,
      "items": {
       "type": "string",
       "maxLength": 1000
      },
      "description": "1-32 segments, each at most 1000 characters"
     },
     "source": {
      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Lang"
     },
     "target": {
      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Lang"
     },
     "style": {
      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Style"
     }
    }
   },
   "TranslateModels": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": [
     "mt",
     "pivot",
     "tier"
    ],
    "properties": {
     "mt": {
      "type": "string",
